{"changelog":"## 新增与调整\r\n\r\n- 首页新增低干扰纯文本轮播，由仓库 JSON 配置总开关、切换时长和链接，复用更新 CDN。\r\n- B 站优先选择可获取的 FLAC 无损音轨，直接复制音视频轨道封装为 MP4；没有 FLAC 时选择最高码率 AAC。\r\n- YouTube 优先选择原语言的高码率 AAC 独立音轨。\r\n- 普通图集按完整配乐时长平均展示每张图片；无配乐时只保存图片。\r\n- 抖音 slides 支持逐张保存 Live 图（Android Motion Photo），配乐单独保存，不制作长视频。\r\n\r\n## 预览版说明\r\n\r\n支持 Android 13 及以上的 64 位设备（arm64-v8a、x86_64）。引入原生无损合并库，安装包体积有所增加。\r\n\r\n构建、单元测试与静态检查已完成；测试作品的 8 张静态图、8 段 Live 视频及配乐均通过在线读取验证。FLAC 合并及目标相册对 Live 图的识别仍待真机验证，不同相册兼容性可能不同。平台提供 WebP 封面时会转为最高质量 JPEG，动态视频原样保留。\r\n\r\n这是 pre-release，不替换正式版更新通道。\r\n\r\n机场推荐：[白月光，稳定高速](https://www.sibker.com/register?invite_code=2XQR1UUz)\r\n","channel":"beta","maxForcedVersionCode":0,"policyRevision":2,"publishedAt":"2026-09-29T08:24:50Z","releaseUrl":"https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/tag/v0.6.15-beta.1","schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"4487cee67fe054ab48873f9f0c503a8bc1c1aea0836860b828be2d466e8b01d3","size":40365559,"urls":["https://gh.3w.pm/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.15-beta.1/DBDown-0.6.15-beta.1.apk","https://v6.gh-proxy.org/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.15-beta.1/DBDown-0.6.15-beta.1.apk","https://gh.jasonzeng.dev/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.15-beta.1/DBDown-0.6.15-beta.1.apk","https://gh.llkk.cc/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.15-beta.1/DBDown-0.6.15-beta.1.apk","https://gh-proxy.org/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.15-beta.1/DBDown-0.6.15-beta.1.apk","https://xget.xi-xu.me/gh/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.15-beta.1/DBDown-0.6.15-beta.1.apk","https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.15-beta.1/DBDown-0.6.15-beta.1.apk","https://gh.monlor.com/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.15-beta.1/DBDown-0.6.15-beta.1.apk","https://ghfast.top/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown/releases/download/v0.6.15-beta.1/DBDown-0.6.15-beta.1.apk","https://ghproxy.vip/https://github.com/daxiaamu/DBdown